[
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# Telegram notifications (owner: Miguel)\n\nPosts two events to Telegram, one way only (broker → Telegram, no webhook, no polling):\n\n1. **A new app report** (`access/barriers/<id>`, ids `b…`) goes to the **public channel** (env `TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID`,\n   e.g. `@rota_livre_porto`), for anyone who follows it: kind, description, a map link and the app link. Once per barrier: the\n   Action keeps a retained marker `access/notify/telegram/sent/<id>`, so republished, retired (`expires_at` = now),\n   deleted (empty payload) and resent reports send nothing. City (`city-*`) and demo (`demo-*`) barriers are never sent.\n2. **A barrier reaches 3 \"Já não está\" answers** (`access/feedback/<id>/gone_count` = 3, any source): the team\n   should review it. It goes to the **team group** only (env `TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID`), never to the channel. Counts only grow,\n   so it sends once per barrier.\n\n- `TeamTelegram` (REST_API connector, the Coreflux Telegram Bot API app trimmed to `sendMessage`) posts every message on\n  `access/notify/telegram/send` to `https://api.telegram.org/bot<token>/sendMessage` and publishes Telegram's answer on\n  `access/notify/telegram/result` (`{\"ok\": true, ...}`, or `{\"success\": false, \"statusCode\": ...}`).\n  **An error result carries the request `endpoint`, token included** (verified 24/10, still empty then): the topic is\n  not retained and only root can read it (the `web` user is limited to `access/barriers/#`); never give another user\n  `access/notify/#`.\n- The bot (@RotaLivreSciTech2026Bot) token is the broker secret `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` (read in the connector's ENDPOINT,\n  never on MQTT). The destinations are broker env: `TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID` (`@username` of the public channel; the bot must\n  be an admin allowed to post) and `TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID` (the team group, a number such as `-1001234567890`). An event\n  whose destination is unset or invalid sends nothing.\n- `TelegramNotify` (Python, pure, tests in `services/tests/test_telegram_notify.py`) builds the `sendMessage` body or\n  returns `skip`. Plain text (no `parse_mode`), so descriptions need no escaping.\n\nSetup: create the bot with @BotFather. Create a public channel and add the bot as an admin that can post. Add the bot to\nthe team group, send `/start@RotaLivreSciTech2026Bot` there and read the group id from\n`https://api.telegram.org/bot<token>/getUpdates`. Then, in the HUB or with the MCP tools: `-setSecret\nTELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=<token>`, `-setEnv TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID=@<channel>` and `-setEnv TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=<group id>`.\nNever commit the token."
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "python",
    "value": "# Script Name: TelegramNotify\n\"\"\"Telegram messages: a new app report (public channel) and a barrier that people say is gone (team group).\n\nFunctions called from LoT take str arguments and return a str (broker 2.22.0): the sendMessage body as JSON, or\n\"skip\" when there is nothing to send. Pure: what was already sent is tracked by the Actions in retained topics.\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport re\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\n\nAPP_ID = re.compile(r\"^b[0-9a-z]{4,40}$\")  # same check as RouteBarrierMessage\nSAFE_ID = re.compile(r\"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$\")\nCHAT_ID = re.compile(r\"^(-?[0-9]{1,20}|@[A-Za-z0-9_]{5,32})$\")\nFRACTION = re.compile(r\"\\.(\\d{6})\\d+\")\nGONE_THRESHOLD = 3\nMAX_DESCRIPTION = 200\nSKIP = \"skip\"\nAPP_URL = \"https://accessible-routes.benlubetzky.workers.dev\"\nKINDS = {  # labels as in the app (BARRIER_KINDS in app/app.js)\n    \"works\": \"Obras ou andaime\",\n    \"blocked_sidewalk\": \"Passeio bloqueado\",\n    \"parked_car\": \"Carro no passeio\",\n    \"broken_lift\": \"Elevador ou rampa avariados\",\n    \"damaged_pavement\": \"Piso danificado\",\n    \"other\": \"Outro\",\n}\n\n\ndef _parse_time(text):\n    \"\"\"ISO 8601 to an aware UTC datetime, or None. Accepts Z and .NET's 7-digit fractions.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(text, str) or not text:\n        return None\n    text = FRACTION.sub(r\".\\1\", text.strip()).replace(\"Z\", \"+00:00\").replace(\"z\", \"+00:00\")\n    try:\n        moment = datetime.fromisoformat(text)\n    except ValueError:\n        return None\n    if moment.tzinfo is None:\n        moment = moment.replace(tzinfo=timezone.utc)\n    return moment.astimezone(timezone.utc)\n\n\ndef _barrier(payload):\n    \"\"\"The barrier dict when the payload is one the app would show (numeric lat/lon), else None.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        report = json.loads(payload) if payload else None\n    except (TypeError, ValueError):\n        return None\n    if not isinstance(report, dict):\n        return None\n    if not all(isinstance(report.get(k), (int, float)) and not isinstance(report.get(k), bool) for k in (\"lat\", \"lon\")):\n        return None\n    return report\n\n\ndef _describe(report):\n    lines = [KINDS.get(str(report.get(\"kind\")), KINDS[\"other\"])]\n    description = \" \".join(str(report.get(\"description\") or \"\").split())\n    if len(description) > MAX_DESCRIPTION:\n        description = description[:MAX_DESCRIPTION - 1].rstrip() + \"…\"\n    if description:\n        lines.append(f\"“{description}”\")\n    lines.append(f\"📍 https://www.google.com/maps?q={report['lat']:.6f},{report['lon']:.6f}\")\n    return lines\n\n\ndef _message(chat_id, lines):\n    return json.dumps({\"chat_id\": chat_id, \"text\": \"\\n\".join(lines), \"disable_web_page_preview\": True})\n\n\ndef new_barrier(barrier_id, payload, chat_id, now):\n    \"\"\"A message on access/barriers/<id>: a new app report (ids b...) that has not expired yet, for the channel.\"\"\"\n    barrier_id, chat_id = str(barrier_id or \"\"), str(chat_id or \"\").strip()\n    report = _barrier(payload)\n    if not APP_ID.match(barrier_id) or not CHAT_ID.match(chat_id) or report is None:\n        return SKIP\n    expires = _parse_time(report.get(\"expires_at\"))\n    if expires is not None and expires <= (_parse_time(now) or datetime.now(timezone.utc)):\n        return SKIP  # a retired barrier is republished with expires_at = now\n    return _message(chat_id, [\"🚧 Novo obstáculo reportado\"] + _describe(report) + [f\"Rota acessível: {APP_URL}\"])\n\n\ndef gone_threshold(barrier_id, gone_count, barrier_payload, chat_id):\n    \"\"\"A new access/feedback/<id>/gone_count: tell the team once, when it reaches GONE_THRESHOLD.\"\"\"\n    barrier_id, chat_id = str(barrier_id or \"\"), str(chat_id or \"\").strip()\n    try:\n        count = int(float(gone_count))\n    except (TypeError, ValueError):\n        return SKIP\n    if count != GONE_THRESHOLD or not SAFE_ID.match(barrier_id) or not CHAT_ID.match(chat_id):\n        return SKIP\n    lines = [f\"⚠️ {count} pessoas dizem que este obstáculo já não está\"]\n    report = _barrier(barrier_payload)\n    if report is not None:\n        lines += _describe(report)\n    lines += [f\"id: {barrier_id}\", \"Rever e, se for o caso, retirá-lo.\"]\n    return _message(chat_id, lines)"
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "lot",
    "value": "DEFINE ROUTE TeamTelegram WITH TYPE REST_API\n    ADD REST_API_CONFIG\n        WITH BASE_ADDRESS \"https://api.telegram.org\"\n        WITH REQUEST_TIMEOUT 20\n    ADD EVENT SendMessage\n        WITH SOURCE_TOPIC \"access/notify/telegram/send\"\n        WITH DESTINATION_TOPIC \"access/notify/telegram/result\"\n        WITH METHOD \"POST\"\n        WITH ENDPOINT \"/bot{secret.TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}/sendMessage\"\n        WITH HEADERS\n            ADD \"Content-Type\" \"application/json\"\n        WITH BODY \"{payload}\""
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "lot",
    "value": "DEFINE ACTION NotifyNewBarrier\nON TOPIC \"access/barriers/+\" DO\n    SET \"barrier_id\" WITH TOPIC POSITION 3\n    IF {barrier_id} MATCHES REGEX \"^b[0-9a-z]{4,40}$\" THEN\n        SET \"sent_topic\" WITH \"access/notify/telegram/sent/\" + {barrier_id}\n        SET \"sent\" WITH GET TOPIC {sent_topic} AS STRING\n        IF {sent} == \"\" THEN\n            SET \"body\" WITH PAYLOAD AS STRING\n            SET \"chat_id\" WITH GET ENV \"TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID\"\n            SET \"now\" WITH TIMESTAMP \"ISO\"\n            CALL PYTHON \"TelegramNotify.new_barrier\"\n                WITH ({barrier_id}, {body}, {chat_id}, {now})\n                RETURN AS {message}\n            IF {message} != \"skip\" THEN\n                PUBLISH TOPIC \"access/notify/telegram/send\" WITH {message}\n                PUBLISH TOPIC {sent_topic} WITH {now} WITH RETAIN QOS1"
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "lot",
    "value": "DEFINE ACTION NotifyGoneThreshold\nON TOPIC \"access/feedback/+/gone_count\" DO\n    SET \"barrier_id\" WITH TOPIC POSITION 3\n    SET \"count\" WITH PAYLOAD AS STRING\n    SET \"barrier\" WITH GET TOPIC \"access/barriers/\" + {barrier_id} AS STRING\n    SET \"chat_id\" WITH GET ENV \"TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID\"\n    CALL PYTHON \"TelegramNotify.gone_threshold\"\n        WITH ({barrier_id}, {count}, {barrier}, {chat_id})\n        RETURN AS {message}\n    IF {message} != \"skip\" THEN\n        PUBLISH TOPIC \"access/notify/telegram/send\" WITH {message}"
  }
]
